    <!-- SECTION 1: WHY BUSINESSES NEED SEO -->
    <section class="why-seo-section" id="why-seo">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="split-grid">
                <div class="split-text">
                    <span class="section-label">Why SEO Matters</span>
                    <h2>Why Your Business Needs a Chicago SEO Company to Win Online</h2>
                    <p>Most buyers in Chicago start their journey on Google. If your business does not appear on the first page, your competitors capture the traffic, the calls, and the revenue that should be yours. Search engine optimization turns that around by placing your brand in front of people at the exact moment they search for what you sell.</p>
                    <p>Unlike paid ads that stop the second you stop paying, SEO builds an asset that compounds. Every optimized page, every earned link, and every positive review makes your presence stronger. A dedicated Chicago SEO company builds that system for you, then keeps refining it as search evolves.</p>
                    <p>Here is what businesses stand to gain when they invest in serious SEO:</p>
                </div>
                <div class="split-visual">
                    <div class="gain-card">
                        <h3>📈 What You Gain With SEO</h3>
                        <div class="gain-row">
                            <div class="gain-icon"></div>
                            <p><strong>Sustained organic traffic</strong> that keeps flowing even when ad budgets pause</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="gain-row">
                            <div class="gain-icon">🎯</div>
                            <p><strong>Higher-intent leads</strong> from people actively searching for your services</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="gain-row">
                            <div class="gain-icon">🏆</div>
                            <p><strong>Brand trust and authority</strong> that comes from ranking at the top of Google</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="gain-row">
                            <div class="gain-icon">💰</div>
                            <p><strong>Compounding ROI</strong> as rankings, links, and content build on each other</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

