    <!-- ABOUT -->
    <section class="about-section" id="about">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="split-grid">
                <div class="split-text">
                    <span class="section-label">About Us</span>
                    <h2>Why We're The Most Trusted Chicago SEO Company Since 2015</h2>
                    <p>WebSurf SEO is a premier <strong>Chicago SEO company</strong> built on transparency, data-driven strategy, and measurable results. Since 2015 we have helped more than 200 businesses across the greater Chicagoland area reach first-page rankings, grow organic traffic, and generate qualified leads through ethical search engine optimization.</p>
                    <p>Our certified specialists combine deep knowledge of Google's ranking algorithms, local search optimization, technical SEO, and AI-powered search to build strategies that drive sustainable growth. No black-hat tactics and no overnight promises. We build long-term authority that compounds over time.</p>
                    <div class="about-features">
                        <div class="about-feature">
                            <div class="about-feature-icon"></div>
                            <p><strong>Experience:</strong> 10+ years optimizing websites for competitive Chicago markets across Cook County and DuPage County</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="about-feature">
