    <!-- SERVICES -->
    <section class="services-section" id="services">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-label">Our Services</span>
                <h2>Complete SEO Services From a Full-Service Chicago SEO Company</h2>
                <p>From local pack dominance to national keyword rankings, our Chicago SEO services cover every part of organic search visibility for businesses across the metropolitan area.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="services-grid">
                <article class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-head">
                        <div class="service-icon">📍</div>
                        <h3>Local SEO Chicago</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p>Dominate Google's local pack, Maps results, and neighborhood searches with optimized Google Business Profiles, local citations, and geo-targeted content built for Chicago's tough market.</p>
                    <div class="service-tags">
                        <span class="service-tag">Google Business Profile</span>
                        <span class="service-tag">Local Citations</span>
                        <span class="service-tag">Maps SEO</span>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-head">
                        <div class="service-icon">⚙️</div>
                        <h3>Technical SEO</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p>Comprehensive audits covering crawlability, indexation, site speed, Core Web Vitals, mobile usability, schema markup, and site architecture so search engines can find and rank your content.</p>
                    <div class="service-tags">
                        <span class="service-tag">Site Audits</span>
                        <span class="service-tag">Core Web Vitals</span>
                        <span class="service-tag">Schema</span>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-head">
                        <div class="service-icon">📝</div>
