    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="faq-section" id="faq">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-label">FAQ</span>
                <h2>Chicago SEO Company Questions, Answered</h2>
                <p>Everything you need to know about working with a Chicago SEO company and winning search visibility in this market.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-container">
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h4>What makes WebSurf SEO the best Chicago SEO company?</h4>
                        <div class="faq-toggle"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <div class="faq-answer-content">
                            <p>WebSurf SEO combines deep Chicago market knowledge with advanced data-driven SEO methodology. Our team has more than 10 years of experience optimizing websites for Chicago businesses across Cook County, DuPage County, and the greater Chicagoland area. Clients see an average organic traffic increase of 312% through custom strategies targeting local search intent, technical optimization, and authority building. We also integrate AI search optimization so your brand stays visible across Google, Bing, ChatGPT, and other emerging platforms.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h4>How long does it take to see SEO results in Chicago?</h4>
                        <div class="faq-toggle"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <div class="faq-answer-content">
                            <p>Most Chicago businesses see measurable improvements within 3 to 6 months, with significant results in 6 to 12 months. Local SEO improvements for Google Business Profile and local pack rankings often appear within 2 to 3 months, and technical SEO fixes can move rankings within weeks. Our monthly reporting lets you track progress in real time across organic traffic, keyword rankings, and conversions.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h4>What areas does WebSurf SEO serve in the Chicago metropolitan area?</h4>
                        <div class="faq-toggle"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <div class="faq-answer-content">
                            <p>We serve businesses throughout the greater Chicago metropolitan area including the Loop, River North, Lincoln Park, Wicker Park, Gold Coast, Lakeview, Hyde Park, Naperville, Evanston, Schaumburg, Oak Park, Arlington Heights, Aurora, Joliet, Elmhurst, and Wheaton, plus surrounding Cook County, DuPage County, Lake County, and Kane County communities. Whether you are a single storefront or a multi-location business, we build geo-targeted strategies for your exact market.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h4>What is the difference between local SEO and national SEO for Chicago businesses?</h4>
                        <div class="faq-toggle"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <div class="faq-answer-content">
                            <p>Local SEO focuses on geographically specific searches, including Google Business Profile optimization, local citations, neighborhood keywords, and proximity ranking factors. National SEO targets broader keywords without geographic limits. Chicago businesses usually benefit from a hybrid approach. A Chicago law firm, for example, would target "Chicago personal injury lawyer" locally while competing for broader terms like "personal injury attorney" nationally.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h4>How much do Chicago SEO services cost?</h4>
                        <div class="faq-toggle"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <div class="faq-answer-content">
                            <p>Chicago SEO services typically range from $2,500 to $15,000 per month depending on scope, competition, and business goals. At WebSurf SEO we build custom strategies instead of cookie-cutter packages. Small local businesses often start around $2,500 per month, mid-market companies typically invest $5,000 to $8,000 per month, and enterprise campaigns require a larger investment. Every engagement begins with a comprehensive audit and a roadmap tied to ROI.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h4>How does WebSurf SEO optimize for AI search platforms?</h4>
                        <div class="faq-toggle"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <div class="faq-answer-content">
                            <p>Our AI search optimization ensures your brand appears in ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Perplexity, and other large language model results. We optimize through structured data markup, entity-based content, topical authority building, conversational keyword targeting, and citation-worthy content. As AI-powered search grows, businesses that optimize for these platforms today gain a serious advantage tomorrow.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

